      "en": "For we will not inherit with them on the other side of the Jordan and beyond, because our inheritance has come to us on this side of the Jordan eastward.”",
      "ko": "우리는 요단 이편 곧 동편에서 산업을 얻었사오니 그들과 함께 요단 저편에서는 기업을 얻지 아니하겠나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "6f8ad442842e9fdb1f3587e265fc1b344599aec8f3526897f689c2b515c35662",
      "translation_text_hash": "8c82322bd47886fbd087640d763d6c196a592ba75ce22b0317fb7d4cdfa2cb5c",
